From: Droidloom <droidloom@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] freedreno: include type_traits directly

Android's libc++ does not expose std::underlying_type_t transitively through
tuple. Include the standard header that defines it.

--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_common.h
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_common.h
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 
 #include <tuple>
+#include <type_traits>
 
 #define __FD_GPU_GENS A6XX, A7XX, A8XX
